sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Caregiver
    participant UI as ObserverHub.razor.cs
    participant BR as inference-bridge.js
    participant W as inference-worker.js
    participant HF as Hugging Face Hub
    participant MW as Middleware pipeline
    participant EP as ObserverEndpoints
    participant SVC as ObservationService
    participant SAN as TelemetryContentSanitizer
    participant SUB as ISubjectRepository
    participant REP as IObservationRepository
    participant ALR as AlertThresholdEvaluator
    participant T as Azure Table Storage
    participant BL as Azure Blob Storage

    Note over U,UI: Session already authenticated — PoWatch.Auth HttpOnly cookie, 24h sliding
    U->>UI: StartMonitoringAsync()
    UI->>UI: RefreshStateAsync() — verify ObservationLoopEnabled
    UI->>BR: powatchInference.startPreview(videoEl)
    BR->>W: LOAD_MODEL(modelKey from model-registry.json)
    W->>HF: fetch config + tokenizer + ONNX weights (retry x3, 600ms backoff)
    HF-->>W: weights
    W->>W: WebGPU fp16 -> fp32 -> WASM q8 fallback chain
    W-->>BR: STATE_UPDATE(loadState=ready, device, dtype)

    loop every PollingIntervalSeconds (default 10s)
        UI->>BR: captureAndInfer(prompt, videoEl, maxNewTokens 32..256)
        BR->>BR: draw frame to canvas, frame-diff vs previous
        alt frame unchanged
            BR-->>UI: IsAvailable=false, "Frame unchanged"
            UI->>UI: _skippedCycles++, no HTTP request
        else changed frame
            BR->>W: RUN_INFERENCE(base64 frame, prompt)
            W->>W: generate(max_new_tokens) — on failure step the fallback chain (4 attempts)
            W-->>BR: raw text + generationDiagnostic
            BR->>BR: reject degenerate/repetitive output
            BR-->>UI: activity, clinicalPayload, confidence, subjectHint, capturedImageDataUrl

            UI->>MW: POST /api/observer/ingest + Cookie + X-Correlation-ID + X-Session-ID
            MW->>MW: exception handler -> HTTPS redirect (non-Dev) -> rate limiter -> correlation id
            MW->>MW: UseAuthentication (cookie / OIDC / FakeAuth) -> UseAuthorization (default policy)
            alt cookie missing or expired
                MW-->>UI: 401 (OnRedirectToLogin returns status, never HTML)
                UI-->>U: "Reconnecting to server" pipeline health latch
            else authenticated
                MW->>EP: route to /api/observer group
                EP->>SVC: IngestAsync(IngestObservationRequestDto)
                alt ObservationLoopEnabled = false
                    SVC-->>EP: Accepted=false, Dropped=true
                else loop enabled
                    SVC->>SVC: IObservationProcessingGate.TryEnter()
                    alt previous cycle still running
                        SVC-->>EP: Dropped — "previous inference still running"
                    else gate acquired
                        SVC->>SAN: TrySanitize(request)
                        alt rejected
                            SAN-->>SVC: reason
                            SVC-->>EP: Dropped — "Rejected by telemetry sanitizer"
                        else clean
                            SVC->>SUB: GetOrCreateAsync(subjectHint)
                            SUB->>T: read/insert PoWatchSubjects (PK 'Subjects', RK subjectId)
                            SUB-->>SVC: SubjectProfile
                            SVC->>SVC: ClinicalTagParser -> outlier? · ActivitySignificanceClassifier -> significant?
                            SVC->>SVC: server-authoritative ObservedAtUtc · RowKey = subjectId_eventId
                            SVC->>REP: AddAsync(observation)
                            REP->>T: AddEntity (PK = UTC yyyyMMdd) — 409 treated as idempotent success
                            SVC->>SUB: UpdateLastActivityAsync (Merge, disjoint columns)
                            SVC->>ALR: Evaluate(observation) — rolling-window rules
                            ALR-->>SVC: triggered alerts
                            SVC-->>EP: Accepted, IsSignificant, IsOutlier, ImageReference, TriggeredAlerts
                        end
                    end
                end
                EP-->>UI: 200 Ok (accepted) or 202 Accepted (dropped)
            end

            opt result.IsSignificant and not dropped/redundant
                UI->>MW: GET /api/blobs/sas?blobPath=...&upload=true
                MW->>EP: BlobEndpoints
                EP-->>UI: BlobAccessDescriptorDto (SAS, expires +30 min)
                UI->>BL: PUT image/jpeg direct to container (browser to storage)
            end

            alt result.IsOutlier
                UI-->>U: full-screen RoomAlertOverlay + audio cue
            else result.IsSignificant
                UI-->>U: Watch-level banner
            else
                UI-->>U: Normal state
            end

            opt persisted something new
                UI->>MW: GET /api/observer/events (SSE) and /api/identity/subjects/live-status (cached 10s)
                MW-->>UI: timeline + subject glance grid
            end
        end
    end

    U->>UI: StopMonitoring
    UI->>BR: cancelInFlight + stopMonitor
